分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(19年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,92.9 9.1,90.6 14.2,94.4 19.3,96.7 24.5,97.2 29.6,93.5 34.7,93.2 39.8,90.3 44.9,85.2 50.0,83.6 55.1,80.4 60.3,75.2 65.4,73.2 70.5,77.0 75.6,71.6 80.7,65.4 85.8,61.2 91.0,67.7 96.1,66.4 101.2,58.1 106.3,54.9 111.4,49.6 116.5,53.7 121.6,55.8 126.8,62.5 131.9,63.9 137.0,62.4 142.1,57.2 147.2,55.1 152.3,59.8 157.4,60.9 162.6,61.2 167.7,64.6 172.8,62.1 177.9,62.5 183.0,47.2 188.1,48.9 193.2,51.4 198.4,52.4 203.5,46.8 208.6,38.6 213.7,39.0 218.8,44.8 223.9,53.5 229.0,40.5 234.2,45.7 239.3,40.5 244.4,27.1 249.5,19.7 254.6,32.6 259.7,28.9 264.9,24.9 270.0,24.1 275.1,19.6 280.2,16.2 285.3,18.6 290.4,13.2 295.5,12.8 300.7,28.1 305.8,28.9 310.9,26.2 316.0,15.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"15.9\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,95.2 6.1,95.2 8.3,96.3 10.4,94.9 12.5,95.3 14.7,95.2 16.8,95.9 19.0,95.2 21.1,95.0 23.2,96.9 25.4,97.2 27.5,95.5 29.6,93.4 31.8,93.0 33.9,91.5 36.1,91.2 38.2,91.4 40.3,79.7 42.5,82.1 44.6,78.6 46.7,76.5 48.9,77.4 51.0,75.2 53.2,75.1 55.3,72.0 57.4,75.2 59.6,72.7 61.7,7